  "ingredients": [
    "1 (9 inch) prepared graham cracker crust",
    "1 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 (10 ounce) package peanut butter chips",
    "2 ounces smooth peanut butter",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup chocolate syrup"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ITBtF8Hx6Owk_qnkl2AJWdoRD-M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-005-step-01-bf65ef9b7400465f947e52dfeb0b5a5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1 cup of cream in a small saucepan. Heat to just below the boiling point.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0eMsNVB6wpw0am50OLZ4kDA6ENI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-006-step-02-1901a5dff99e405e9e77accb0f58c086.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place peanut butter chips, peanut butter, and vanilla extract in food processor. With processor running, slowly drizzle hot cream down pouring chute. Process until mixture is completely smooth. Set aside to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gu2fj8DB8MmkqkgDFHdHu_F7jjU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-007-step-03-3ef1c2dfd5b34abcb60231381f68d5a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whip cream in a large bowl until soft mounds form. Slowly add sugar while continuing to beat until cream forms stiff peaks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ff5_ZXzO94C6Ks_FQmqpPvCQm_U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-008-step-04-0327a487170442ecb93db362333721a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold in cooled peanut butter mixture. Do not incorporate completely; leave some white streaks in mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ued_MJ3y1g90QfO8wxmlUB9VPo8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-009-step-05-a9826603398646f98893b4f7c9df2c9c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into graham cracker crust and chill at least 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3TpkZePdIbgVckKSlbFBD_cJZEQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-010-step-06-c2bc7cce33c34bf4872e87b1dcad9de6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle each plate with chocolate syrup before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iiJ1udRRgsekOXksq3T6T24SlwM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15803-peanut-butter-pie-xv-VAT-011-step-07-4eb42120324b498d8f4452a6de371fce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15803/step_07.webp"
    }
